            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>PREFATORY NOTE</head>
               <p rend="justify">These drawings are selections from Cartoons published, for the most part, in a daily newspaper. They represent the emotions evoked by the news from day to day, and make no pretense to a philosophic viewpoint. They do seek to express, however, a deep conviction that Germany is chiefly to blame for the war.</p>
               <p rend="justify">Boardman Robinson.</p>
               <p rend="justify">
                  <hi rend="italic">April, 1915.</hi>
               </p>
            </div>
